em":"51 FR 19159, PDF pages 17-18","sha256":"ae02559618bdb84505324e50b3711c31e88b94425270e3fe3f984cbda5611661","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1986-05-28/pdf/FR-1986-05-28.pdf"},"signing_date":"1986-05-24","source_id":"fr-originals:EO:12560:ae02559618bd","strong":true,"text_path":"texts/EO_12560.txt","why":"page location high; location_verified is false - open the PDF pages"}],"savings_leads":[],"whole_order_end":[],"whole_order_end_total":0},"provisional_status":"yes","readiness":{"by_step":{"clause_inventory":"confirm","counterevidence":"confirm","ending_or_current_basis":"research","opus_media":"n/a","original_text":"confirm","savings_residuals":"agent_judgment","shared_sources":"n/a"},"needs_research":["ending_or_current_basis"],"would_satisfy_once_confirmed":["original_text","clause_inventory","counterevidence"]},"shared_sources":[],"signing_dates_seen":{"fr-originals@jobs/fr-originals/output":"1986-05-24","later-events_catalog":"1986-05-24","stage19_causal_queue":"1986-05-24"},"source_ladder_exhausted_proposed":[],"status":"MACHINE DRAFT - UNVERIFIED; not a claim; see jobs/claim-drafts/AGENT_GUIDE.md"},"claim":{"instrument_id":"EO:12560","later_source_search":[],"operative_clauses":[{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Section 1. Section l-102(a) of Executive Order No. 12163, as amended, is  \nfurther amended by deleting paragraph “(6)” and adding the following new \nparagraphs at the end thereof:\n“(6) section 903(b) of the International Security and Development Cooperation \nAct of 1985 (hereinafter referred to as “ISDCA of 1985”);\n“(7) section 709 of the ISDCA of 1985, which authority shall be exercised in  \nconsultation with the Secretary of State and the Secretary of Defense;\n‘‘(8) sections 1205(b) and 1210 of the ISDCA of 1985;”\n‘‘(9) section 541 of the Foreign Assistance and Related Programs Appropria­\ntions Act, 1986 (as enacted in Public Law 99-190), to be exercised by the  \nAdministrator of the Agency for International Development within IDCA;”  \nand\n“(10) the first proviso under the heading “Population, Development Assist­\nance” contained in Title II of the Foreign Assistance and Related Programs  \nAppropriations Act, 1986 (as enacted in Public Law 99-190), to be exercised by \nthe Administrator of the Agency for International Development within IDCA.”.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"51 FR 19159, PDF pages 17-18; Sec. 1","sha256":"ae02559618bdb84505324e50b3711c31e88b94425270e3fe3f984cbda5611661","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1986-05-28/pdf/FR-1986-05-28.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12560#sec1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 2. Section l-201(a) of Executive Order No. 12163, as amended, is further  \namended by deleting paragraphs “(7)”, “(22)”, “(23)”, “(25)”, “(26)”, and “(27)”, \nrenumbering the remaining paragraphs accordingly, and inserting the follow­\ning new paragraphs at the end thereof:\n“(23) sections 462, 464(d)(2), 620E(e), and 660(d) of the Act;\n“(24) section 129(b) of the ISDCA of 1985, which shall be exercised in  \nconsultation with the Secretary of Defense and the Director of the Arms  \nControl and Disarmament Agency;\n“(25) sections 207, 552(b), 611, 612(a), 617(c), 702(c), 703(a), 705 (b> and (c), 706, \n722(j), 813(b) and 1008 of the ISDCA of 1985;”.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"51 FR 19159, PDF pages 17-18; Sec. 2","sha256":"ae02559618bdb84505324e50b3711c31e88b94425270e3fe3f984cbda5611661","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1986-05-28/pdf/FR-1986-05-28.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12560#sec2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 3. Section l-201(a) of Executive Order No. 12163, as amended, is further  \namended by deleting “481, and 502B,” from paragraph (1) and inserting  \n“section 305” in lieu thereof, and inserting the following new paragraphs at the \nend thereof:\n“(26) chapter 8 of part I of the Act, except for section 481(h), which is reserved \nto the President”;\n\"(27) section 502B of the Act;” and\n“(28) sections 527, 528, 537, 543 and 547 of the Foreign Assistance and Related \nPrograms Appropriations Act, 1986 (as enacted in Public Law 99-190).”.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"51 FR 19159, PDF pages 17-18; Sec. 3","sha256":"ae02559618bdb84505324e50b3711c31e88b94425270e3fe3f984cbda5611661","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1986-05-28/pdf/FR-1986-05-28.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12560#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 4. Section l-201(a)(3) of Executive Order No. 12163, as amended, is  \nfurther amended to read as follows:\n\n=== PDF page 18 of 184 ===\n19160 Federal Register / Vol. 51, No. 102 / Wednesday, May 28, 1986 / Presidential Documents\n“(3) section 505(a) relating to other provisions which may be required by the \nPresident, and sections 505 (d), (e), (f) and (g) of the Act.”.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"51 FR 19159, PDF pages 17-18; Sec. 4","sha256":"ae02559618bdb84505324e50b3711c31e88b94425270e3fe3f984cbda5611661","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1986-05-28/pdf/FR-1986-05-28.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12560#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 5. Section 1— 201 (a)(22) of Executive Order No. 12163, as redesignated by \nthis Order, is further amended by inserting immediately after \"(Public Law 98- \n525)” the phrase \"as amended by section 306 of the Department of Defense  \nAuthorization Act, 1986 (Public Law 99-145),”.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"51 FR 19159, PDF pages 17-18; Sec. 5","sha256":"ae02559618bdb84505324e50b3711c31e88b94425270e3fe3f984cbda5611661","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1986-05-28/pdf/FR-1986-05-28.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12560#sec5","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 6. Section l-201(a)(15) of Executive Order No. 12163, as amended, as  \nredesignated by this Order, is further amended by deleting “(other than  \nchapter 4 thereof)”.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"51 FR 19159, PDF pages 17-18; Sec. 6","sha256":"ae02559618bdb84505324e50b3711c31e88b94425270e3fe3f984cbda5611661","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1986-05-28/pdf/FR-1986-05-28.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12560#sec6","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 7. Section 1-301 of Executive Order No. 12163, as amended, is further  \namended by adding the following paragraph at the end thereof:\n\"(e) Those functions conferred upon the President under section 616 of the  \nISDCA of 1985.”.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"51 FR 19159, PDF pages 17-18; Sec. 7","sha256":"ae02559618bdb84505324e50b3711c31e88b94425270e3fe3f984cbda5611661","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1986-05-28/pdf/FR-1986-05-28.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12560#sec7","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 8. Section l-301(c) of Executive Order No. 12163, as amended, is further  \namended to read as follows:\n\"(c) Those functions under section 634A of the Act, to the extent they relate to \nnotifications to the Congress concerning changes in programs under part II of \nthe Act (except chapters 4, 6, and 8 thereof) and under the Arms Export  \nControl Act, as amended, subject to prior consultation with the Secretary of  \nState.”.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"51 FR 19159, PDF pages 17-18; Sec. 8","sha256":"ae02559618bdb84505324e50b3711c31e88b94425270e3fe3f984cbda5611661","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1986-05-28/pdf/FR-1986-05-28.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12560#sec8","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_pre